      "statement": "The subjects module owns the shared subject catalog (stable subject_id UUIDs, canonical_name, name_embedding), personal subject names (user_subject_names), subject suggestion ranking, and subject-name checks (normalization, near-duplicate reuse, personal-data/offensive check). It has no dependency on any other business module.",
