      "id": "claim_9b2fd0d4a4544d888074af1748c13168",
      "statement": "Subject names in the shared catalog are visible to all users. The accepted residual risk of sensitive names entering the catalog is mitigated by the 60-char limit, normalization, near-duplicate reuse, and the LLM name check; admin catalog moderation tooling is a known backlog item.",
